{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.098596320481696864,"w":0.21676623026529945,"h":0.019043550614895155,"c":1,"x":0.13336991524766878,"t":"Sample Writing answers"},{"x":0.13155884714272234,"h":0.022508288721594605,"c":1,"y":0.14225029890069574,"w":0.339794692993164,"t":"TEST 1, WRITING TASK 2"},{"x":0.13160819355938769,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.0 score.","w":0.6544598388671875,"h":0.019034802422225772,"y":0.17657107032065733,"c":1},{"x":0.13154684716271617,"c":1,"h":0.023016569049956526,"t":"In some countries the ownership of peoples home is an important matter. In these countries it is","w":0.76364837646484374,"y":0.19966201978764708},{"w":0.76967508951822927,"c":1,"t":"very important to own your own home rather than renting it. It might be indifferent for some, out","x":0.13162267529003421,"y":0.22044578323571395,"h":0.020985769579632385},{"x":0.1316872442527332,"w":0.21193415323893228,"c":1,"t":"for these people it matter.","y":0.2441107184442769,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"h":0.023200539453009927,"y":0.26530127641912826,"t":"Why is that the case? you might wonder. I think it is because your home is supposed to be exactly","x":0.13156142164718715,"c":1,"w":0.76981633504231772},{"y":0.28471731428554892,"c":1,"t":"what it sounds like, your home. As a human I think we long affer having stuff to call our own,","w":0.73689437866210938,"h":0.024862165866667563,"x":0.13154256258664002},{"w":0.784081776936849,"t":"doesn't matter what it is, but humans will always want to claim ownership. This is nothing new and it","x":0.1336859073856429,"y":0.30517392749335071,"h":0.02080535888671875,"c":1},{"x":0.13155066272158186,"t":"has been like this through human history, like colonies for example, which later once again became","h":0.024574502196834325,"y":0.32252279639551185,"w":0.78013778686523427,"c":1},{"w":0.75130381266276025,"h":0.023151406691408583,"c":1,"y":0.34162197114587811,"t":"the same country as before lead by its own inhabitants. People will always want to be the one to","x":0.1315497408426026},{"y":0.36313707994610422,"w":0.74093002319335932,"t":"decide what happens to them and when you rent your home you can't even paint it without the","x":0.13365010111213793,"h":0.020790362947821217,"c":1},{"w":0.15020576477050784,"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.3880813951985802,"x":0.13374485422079657,"c":1,"t":"owners permission."},{"w":0.72247314453125,"h":0.02234814557366438,"c":1,"t":"If you as a person are renting an apartment there might be a lot of stressors in your life. A","x":0.1336327587578367,"y":0.4082629731433921},{"y":0.42750865266795168,"x":0.1336167161234558,"w":0.76774607340494794,"c":1,"t":"scratched wall can cause you a major headache, because the wall was not yours. The bedroom you","h":0.021445807916396387},{"x":0.13360434211471992,"y":0.44687967838689313,"t":"are currently sleeping in might not be available as long as you hope, things happen in life and","w":0.7390202840169271,"h":0.024106885013647661,"c":1},{"x":0.13374486140649111,"t":"maybe the next landlord won't want to have you as a tenant.","y":0.46790341598322005,"w":0.47530863444010418,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1},{"h":0.023728180830273615,"c":1,"t":"In other perspective, not owning your home could be a relief when it comes to your finance. As","x":0.13356595731613197,"y":0.49137470781214376,"w":0.74520161946614583},{"y":0.51132713343774328,"w":0.74106079101562505,"t":"a renter you won't have to pay mortgage, take loans or spend an awful lot of money on buying","x":0.13357632325912333,"h":0.02400482950558791,"c":1},{"h":0.020728092171137691,"x":0.13367334618004029,"y":0.53179586047140015,"w":0.75323781331380202,"t":"the property. You wouldn't have to worry about the house market crashing or a natural disaster","c":1},{"y":0.55377907015028982,"h":0.018953557008848931,"t":"destroying your expensive home.","w":0.25720163981119792,"x":0.13374485898622937,"c":1},{"x":0.13572370634496497,"h":0.020221000284974533,"t":"Bottom line, as a human I feel like we need to have a home and calling it your own can make that","y":0.57745455351516162,"w":0.77177525838216132,"c":1},{"t":"more special. I personally would rather own my house, because then whatever happens it is on me","y":0.59593044833118347,"x":0.13363541248703162,"h":0.022182976820443678,"c":1,"w":0.76771184285481775},{"x":0.13369434743149552,"t":"and no one else.","y":0.61857527964781456,"w":0.13603644053141276,"h":0.016028998456939281,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.13580247468285545,"w":0.29629628499348959,"h":0.01472320376914027,"y":0.65253239097779336},{"c":1,"y":0.68459302310821846,"t":"The candidate clearly explains why home ownership may be of importance to some","x":0.17901235159949835,"w":0.73868311564127609,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"c":1,"y":0.69998822583365794,"h":0.018257459004720089,"t":"people. She or he also explores the positive and negative sides of owning your own","x":0.17891187847827297,"w":0.7409284973144532},{"c":1,"w":0.69988204956054678,"x":0.17888517151615854,"y":0.71595105247820867,"t":"home before putting forward his or her own opinion. The task is well addressed","h":0.0192219382601716},{"h":0.020949015488192058,"y":0.73249817951190421,"t":"and ideas are explored in some depth. Organisation is clear, with good use of","x":0.17887168287387512,"w":0.68962137858072914,"c":1},{"w":0.72447097778320324,"y":0.74908691887876966,"h":0.019526752341622045,"c":1,"t":"cohesive devices and paragraphing and the message is easy to follow. The range","x":0.17891776143296984},{"x":0.17886189013547324,"h":0.021724709914064722,"c":1,"w":0.72255915323893227,"t":"of vocabulary is appropriate, with examples of less common items [\/ong affer \/ for","y":0.76505550382920817},{"h":0.018783573829102673,"x":0.17686984211317186,"c":1,"w":0.73064366658528646,"y":0.78330171030018969,"t":"| house \/ housing market] and good use of collocations [claim ownership | a major"},{"y":0.79971908151483295,"x":0.17892258413502921,"w":0.73066360473632797,"h":0.019357998042561553,"c":1,"t":"headache | pay mortgage | natural disaster | The bottom line]. There is a variety of"},{"w":0.74294565836588544,"y":0.81680213967528503,"c":1,"h":0.018498301646453941,"t":"complex sentence structures, with a high level of accuracy and only a minor error in","x":0.17894136751235198},{"y":0.83568904592806847,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"w":0.27983538309733069,"x":0.18106996270373524,"t":"punctuation [owners \/ owner's]."},{"c":1,"w":0.03497942288716635,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.13786008269864936,"y":0.91860465100435762,"t":"128"}]}